<Shell title="Publications & Talks" section="publications"><div class="wrap"><header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">PUBLICATIONS</span><h1>Publications <span class="serif accent">& Talks.</span></h1><p>Papers I've published and talks I've given, with links to the original work and slides.</p></header>
